</ul>

User guide: <a href="sa-guide-17.pdf">sa-guide-17.pdf</a> <br>
Python 2 scripts: <a href="sa-scripts-17.tar.gz">sa-scripts-17.tar.gz</a>
<ul>
<li> Subdomain modeling works with both ADCIRC and coupled ADCIRC+SWAN runs.
<li> A remapping script is now included for subdomains whose boundary
 node numbers differ from those of the full domain.
</ul>
</blockquote>

